attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on the anchor and a short spine.** Column 0, `rcnB`, is carried by 100% of chromosomes, persistent, in a region of plasticity in 1% of calls {S1}. The model names 97% of them, 0.33 bits {S1}.

@variable **A variable column follows at 1**, `rcnA`, carried by 88% {S2.c1}. Then columns 11-17, `gatY` to `gatR`, are [[galactitol transport and tagatose bisphosphate]] {S6, Q}. Through columns 36-46 a branch of 11 shell families runs in 10-11%, [[phage capsid and lysis]] {S12.b36}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 90% against 78%, and hesitates less there, 0.43 against 0.66 bits {M}. It hesitates most at column 66, `rfbC`, a variable column, 1.42 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends in the `his` genes**, columns 78-79, `hisIE` and `hisF`, carried by 56% and 50% {S12.c78, S12.c79}. The last column is `hisF`, in 50% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 81% of genes**, 0.61 bits on average, perplexity 2.4 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 0.94 against 0.29 bits, and names fewer genes, 71% against 91% {C}.

